{{ 'it-hero-premium.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'it-hero-premium-dark.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- comment -%}
  El CSS vivia dentro de esta seccion (16 KB en total). Se saco a dos assets
  para poder editar el marcado sin reenviar la hoja de estilos entera.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign hero_handle = section.settings.hero_handle | default: 'iphone-18-pro-max'
  assign hp = all_products[hero_handle]
  assign hero_img = section.settings.hero_image
  if hero_img == blank and hp != blank
    assign hero_img = hp.featured_image
  endif
  assign hero_title = section.settings.heading | default: 'iPhone 18 Pro Max'
-%}
<section class="it-hp">
  <div class="it-hp-inner">

    <div class="it-hp-text">
      <div class="it-hp-eyebrow-row">
        <span class="it-hp-dot"></span>
        <span class="it-hp-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | default: 'Nuevo 2026' }}</span>
        {%- if section.settings.show_stock -%}
        <span class="it-hp-stock-pill"><span class="it-hp-stock-dot"></span>{{ section.settings.stock_text | default: 'En stock' }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <h1 class="it-hp-title">{{ hero_title }}<br><span class="it-hp-title-sub">{{ section.settings.heading2 | default: 'al mejor precio de Espa&ntilde;a.' }}</span></h1>

      {%- comment -%}
        El precio tachado y el ahorro llevaban "| default: '1.649'" y
        "| default: '200'". El filtro default de Liquid trata la cadena vacia
        como "sin valor", asi que vaciar el ajuste no quitaba el tachado: lo
        dejaba clavado en 1.649. Eso pintaba un descuento inventado sobre
        cualquier producto, que es justo lo que prohibe la Directiva Omnibus.
        Ahora cada trozo solo se pinta si tiene valor de verdad.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="it-hp-price-row">
        {%- comment -%}
          El precio sale del producto del hero (el mas barato de sus variantes).
          Escrito a mano se quedaba atras: la portada seguia en 1.800 con el
          producto ya a 1.649. El ajuste "Precio" solo se usa si el producto
          no existe.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <span class="it-hp-price">&euro;{%- if hp != blank and hp.price > 0 -%}{%- render 'it-euros', cents: hp.price -%}{%- else -%}{{ section.settings.price }}{%- endif -%}</span>
        {%- if section.settings.price_compare != blank -%}
          <span class="it-hp-price-old">&euro;{{ section.settings.price_compare }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.price_save != blank -%}
          <span class="it-hp-price-save">Ahorras &euro;{{ section.settings.price_save }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <div class="it-hp-pills">
        <span class="it-hp-pill"><span class="it-hp-check"></span>Sellado de f&aacute;brica</span>
        <span class="it-hp-pill"><span class="it-hp-check"></span>Garant&iacute;a 3 a&ntilde;os</span>
        <span class="it-hp-pill"><span class="it-hp-check"></span>Env&iacute;o 24h gratis</span>
        <span class="it-hp-pill"><span class="it-hp-check"></span>100% original</span>
      </div>

      <div class="it-hp-actions">
        <a href="{{ section.settings.cta1_url | default: hp.url }}" class="it-hp-cta-primary">
          {{ section.settings.cta1_text | default: 'Comprar ahora' }}
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
        </a>
        {%- comment -%} El boton 2 solo aparece si tiene texto Y enlace. {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.cta2_text != blank and section.settings.cta2_url != blank -%}
          <a href="{{ section.settings.cta2_url }}" class="it-hp-cta-secondary">{{ section.settings.cta2_text }}</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Los colores se sacan del propio producto del hero. Antes eran enlaces a
        variantes escritas a mano, que se quedaron apuntando a productos
        archivados y daban 404 justo bajo el boton principal.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if hp != blank -%}
        <div class="it-hp-bottom">
          {%- assign seen = '' -%}
          {%- for v in hp.variants -%}
            {%- assign c = v.option2 -%}
            {%- unless c == blank or seen contains c -%}
              {%- assign seen = seen | append: c | append: '|' -%}
              <a href="{{ hp.url }}?variant={{ v.id }}" class="it-hp-color-link">{{ c }}</a>
            {%- endunless -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          <a href="{{ hp.url }}" class="it-hp-color-link">Ver todos los modelos &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="it-hp-visual">
      <span class="it-hp-glow"></span>
      <div class="it-hp-frame">
        <span class="it-hp-frame-chip"><span class="it-hp-chip-dot"></span>Sellado &middot; Nuevo</span>
        {%- if hero_img != blank -%}
          <img src="{{ hero_img | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ hero_title | escape }}" width="800" height="800" loading="eager" class="it-hp-img">
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="it-hp-img-ph">{{ hero_title }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="it-hp-float it-hp-float-1">
        <span class="it-hp-float-ic">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/><path d="M16 8h4l3 5v3h-7V8z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div><p class="it-hp-float-t">Entrega en 24h</p><p class="it-hp-float-s">Gratis con Correos</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="it-hp-float it-hp-float-2">
        <span class="it-hp-float-ic">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div><p class="it-hp-float-t">Garant&iacute;a 3 a&ntilde;os</p><p class="it-hp-float-s">100% original</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name":"Hero Premium",
  "settings":[
    {"type":"text","id":"hero_handle","label":"Handle del producto del hero (de ahi salen foto y colores)","default":"iphone-18-pro-max"},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"hero_image","label":"Imagen del hero (vacio = foto del producto de arriba)"},
    {"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"Nuevo 2026"},
    {"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Titulo linea 1","default":"iPhone 18 Pro Max"},
    {"type":"text","id":"heading2","label":"Titulo linea 2","default":"256 GB"},
    {"type":"text","id":"price","label":"Precio (solo si no hay producto: si lo hay, sale de Shopify)","default":"1.849"},
    {"type":"text","id":"price_compare","label":"Precio tachado (vacio = no se pinta)"},
    {"type":"text","id":"price_save","label":"Ahorro mostrado (vacio = no se pinta)"},
    {"type":"text","id":"cta1_text","label":"Boton 1","default":"Comprar ahora"},
    {"type":"url","id":"cta1_url","label":"URL boton 1"},
    {"type":"text","id":"cta2_text","label":"Boton 2 (vacio para ocultarlo)"},
    {"type":"url","id":"cta2_url","label":"URL boton 2 (vacio para ocultarlo)"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_stock","label":"Mostrar etiqueta de stock","default":false},
    {"type":"text","id":"stock_text","label":"Texto stock","default":"En stock"}
  ],
  "presets":[{"name":"Hero Premium"}]
}
{% endschema %}
